    <summary>Open-source PDF editor for Windows with text editing, OCR, annotations, redaction, signatures, forms, Office export and page organization.</summary>
    <description>PDF editor for Windows. View, annotate, OCR, merge, split, edit text, draw, sign, fill forms, redact, protect, convert, print, flatten, and open password-protected PDFs without an Adobe subscription or telemetry.

**Features:**

- Rendering, text extraction, search, editing and document processing through KillerPDF's own PDF engine
- Four view modes (Single, Continuous, Two-Page with a book layout option, Grid), tabbed documents that restore their page, zoom and view mode, and a split pane (F10) for two documents side by side
- Sidebar panels for pages, outline, comments, attachments, layers and signatures, dockable on any side of the window; tabs at the top or the bottom
- Edit a page's own text line by line or by paragraph, with font matching, or change matching text everywhere with Find and Replace
- Word-wrapping text boxes, freehand drawing, straight lines, shapes, highlights, strikethrough, underline, stamps and images, with a full RGB color picker and screen eyedropper
- Calibrated Distance, Perimeter, Area and Angle measurements with units, snapping and a measurement report
- Built-in OCR, no cloud: OCR a page or dragged region to the clipboard, make a searchable PDF, extract all text, or convert a scan to real text; extra languages download on demand
- Export to Word, Excel, PowerPoint, HTML, Markdown, text, JSON and page images, with reviewed table export to XLSX or CSV; convert Word and Excel files to PDF; scan pages in through TWAIN
- Permanent redaction by area, text search or sensitive-data pattern, with verification, batches and optional sanitization
- Protect copies with passwords, permissions or certificate recipients; open certificate-encrypted PDFs; restricted PDFs open read-only and unlock with the owner password
- Form filling with live text, checkbox, radio, dropdown and comb fields; recognize fields, flatten forms, exchange FDF and XFDF data and supported calculations
- Digital signatures with a certificate from Windows or a .pfx file, RFC 3161 timestamps, signature verification with certificate chains and later-change detection; draw and reuse signatures and initials or import an image
- Compare two documents side by side with the changes marked; merge, split, extract, reorder, rotate, reverse, straighten and divide scanned spreads; drop a folder or ZIP to merge its contents
- Rotate, scale, flip, straighten a crooked scan, correct the perspective of a photographed page, adjust color and levels, crop with corner handles, and rasterize a region
- Headers, footers, page numbers, watermarks and Bates batches; N-up, booklet, poster and cut-stack production layouts; preflight, accessibility and print-production reports with guided repairs; Reduce File Size
- Guided tasks, reusable macros, watched folders and data merge from CSV, JSON or XLSX
- Full command line with scripting-friendly exit codes: merge, split, extract, render, print, OCR, redact, export, protect, batch render and batch resave
- Bookmark navigation and editing, table of contents generation, page labels, link and bookmark audits, full-text search with result highlighting, and column-aware text selection
- Undo and redo across annotations, page operations and document edits, plus browser-style jump history (Alt+arrows)
- Print with a real in-app preview (paper size and source, scale, position, margins, pages-per-sheet, two-sided)
- Optional File Explorer and Outlook PDF previews for installed copies
- Thirteen themes, live accent colors and toolbar styles provide 41 looks; localized in twenty languages; app-wide interface scale and customizable shortcuts
- Keyboard shortcut overlay (F1) with list and keyboard views, and Search Tools (Ctrl+K) to find any command by name
- Optional startup update checks, enabled by default, with confirmation before downloading or installing
- Separate compact installer and self-contained portable downloads; the installer supports per-user or machine-wide installation and uses the .NET 10 Desktop Runtime
- GPLv3, local-only, no account, no telemetry
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/SteveTheKiller/KillerPDF/releases/tag/vREPLACE_VERSION</releaseNotes>
